{"pageid":4151,"title":"Fairway Island","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Fairway Island</span>","revid":20971,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #FCBA03; background:#6e470c; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"10\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/44/Hexagon_Construction.png/revision/latest?cb=20250626004512\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Construction\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/44/Hexagon_Construction.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20250626004512\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Construction.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Construction.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><p style=\"margin-bottom:.3em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:bold\">This page is under construction!</span><br />\n<span>This page is currently undergoing structural revisions. Please wait patiently until it is fully updated! You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Fairway_Island?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fairway_Island\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041421\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Main Titles\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20250605041421\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Main Titles.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Main_Titles.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> Fairway Island</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Fairway Island</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/52/Fairway_Island.png/revision/latest?cb=20250614150722\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Fairway Island\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/52/Fairway_Island.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250614150722\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/52/Fairway_Island.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250614150722 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/52/Fairway_Island.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250614150722 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Fairway Island\" width=\"270\" height=\"129\" data-image-key=\"Fairway_Island.png\" data-image-name=\"Fairway Island.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mr. Golf</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Golfing materials and the Golden Golf Club Quest</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">ver1.84.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n<b>Fairway Island</b>, added to Oaklands in the 1.84.0 update alongside golf-themed items, is a special location connecting to the Grasslands Beach in <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a>. The island offers a golfing shop, which offers golf clubs, special turf materials, and other golf-related items. The island offers 18 holes in total. These 18 holes are based off of locations in other parts of Oaklands, including <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater\" title=\"Ferwater\">Ferwater</a>, the Desert Highlands, Mushroom/<a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a>, Boomite Caves, the Finlay Taiga, the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowy_peaks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowy peaks\">Snowy Peaks</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Icelands\" title=\"Icelands\">Icelands</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Caves\" title=\"River Caves\">River Caves</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a>. \n</p><p>Note that all the stone/ore nodes and trees that are here serve as obstacles <i>only</i>. You can not use any axe or pickaxe on any of the resources that spawn here. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stores\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Hexagon_Stores.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605040516\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Stores\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Hexagon_Stores.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250605040516\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Stores.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Stores.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> Stores</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hole_in_One\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Subtitle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Subtitle.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Subtitle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250605041031\" /></a></span> Hole in One</span></h3>\n<p>The <b>Hole in One</b> is the only shop on Fairway Island. The store is run by Mr. Golf. The store offers a wide variety of Golf-related items, specifically the golf clubs needed to complete the Golden Golf Club quest. Furthermore, he offers Seasonal Grass that changes with the biome you spawn in and dyeable golfing Turf. The store also offers special Tube schematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Unlike cars, Golf Clubs and Drivers all have equal probabilities of color.</li>\n<li>Golf Clubs have a 1/100,000 or 0.001% chance to be a Neon variant (even <i>rarer</i> than Neon variant cars at 1/10000!).\n<ul><li>Normal Golf Clubs sell for $1000. To have an estimated 100% chance of obtaining one, it would roughly cost <u>$10 million</u> for a Neon Golf Club, depending on RNG.</li>\n<li>Normal Drivers sell for $3000. To have an estimated 100% chance of obtaining one, it would roughly cost <u>$30 million</u> for a Neon Driver, depending on RNG.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests_and_Secrets\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2a/Hexagon_Quests.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605040724\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Quests\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Quests.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Quests.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2a/Hexagon_Quests.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250605040724\" /></a></span> Quests and Secrets</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ac/Golden_Golf_Club%2C_Golden_Driver_Golf_Club%2C_and_Golden_Golf-Tee.png/revision/latest?cb=20250614151141\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Golden Golf Club, Golden Driver Golf Club, and Golden Golf-Tee as reward for the Golf Quest.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"104\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Golden Golf Club, Golden Driver Golf Club, and Golden Golf-Tee.png\" data-image-key=\"Golden_Golf_Club%2C_Golden_Driver_Golf_Club%2C_and_Golden_Golf-Tee.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ac/Golden_Golf_Club%2C_Golden_Driver_Golf_Club%2C_and_Golden_Golf-Tee.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250614151141\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ac/Golden_Golf_Club%2C_Golden_Driver_Golf_Club%2C_and_Golden_Golf-Tee.png/revision/latest?cb=20250614151141\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Golden Golf Club, Golden Driver Golf Club, and Golden Golf-Tee as reward for the Golf Quest.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ac/Golden_Golf_Club%2C_Golden_Driver_Golf_Club%2C_and_Golden_Golf-Tee.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250614151141\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"104\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Golden Golf Club, Golden Driver Golf Club, and Golden Golf-Tee.png\" data-image-key=\"Golden_Golf_Club%2C_Golden_Driver_Golf_Club%2C_and_Golden_Golf-Tee.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ac/Golden_Golf_Club%2C_Golden_Driver_Golf_Club%2C_and_Golden_Golf-Tee.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250614151141\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Golden_Golf_Club,_Golden_Driver_Golf_Club,_and_Golden_Golf-Tee.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Golden Golf Club, Golden Driver Golf Club, and Golden Golf-Tee as reward for the Golf Quest.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Golden_Golf_Club\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Subtitle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Subtitle.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Subtitle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250605041031\" /></a></span> The Golden Golf Club</span></h3>\n<p>When talking with the NPC, Mr. Golf, in the shop, he reveals that he will provide a special reward to those who complete all 18 holes on Fairway Island. However, you do not need to talk to Mr. Golf to initiate the quest. After completing all 18 holes, talk with Mr. Golf to claim your reward. He will provide you with the Golden Golf Club, the Golden Driver Golf Club, and the Golden Golf Tee.\n</p>\n<ul><li>This quest can take some time depending on how skilled you are at ROBLOX golf to complete.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Secret_Bonus_Holes\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Subtitle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Subtitle.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Subtitle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250605041031\" /></a></span> Secret Bonus Holes</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cb/Fairway_Island_19th_Hole.png/revision/latest?cb=20250614171720\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Secret Bonus Hole on a Rock\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"146\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Fairway Island 19th Hole.png\" data-image-key=\"Fairway_Island_19th_Hole.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cb/Fairway_Island_19th_Hole.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250614171720\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cb/Fairway_Island_19th_Hole.png/revision/latest?cb=20250614171720\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Secret Bonus Hole on a Rock\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cb/Fairway_Island_19th_Hole.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250614171720\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"146\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Fairway Island 19th Hole.png\" data-image-key=\"Fairway_Island_19th_Hole.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cb/Fairway_Island_19th_Hole.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250614171720\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Fairway_Island_19th_Hole.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Secret Bonus Hole on a Rock</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>There are several secret holes on Fairway Island, but they <u>do not give any rewards</u>. Even so, these holes are typically much harder compared to the standard set of 18 holes for the Golden Golf Club quest. For example, one of these holes is located on a rock island.\n</p><p>Instead of following the normal path from the entrance, drive to the right - you should see a small brown rock island off a bit into the distance. There is, in fact, a golf flagpole on this small island. The golf tee for this secret 19th hole is on a stump; follow the signs in the small forest to reach it. A Driver Golf Club appears to be required to score on this hole.\n</p><p>Secret route 20 - from the magma caves to the IceLands peaks. In one of the corners of the magma cave, find a golf ball and bring it to the top of the left IceLands mountain.\n</p><p>Secret route 21 - from the peak of AcidLands to the oasis. Find a ball on one of the peaks in AcidLands and then bring it to the farthest edge of the oasis, to the hole below the waterfall.\n</p><p>Please note that there are no rewards for secret holes. Take your time at your own risk.\n</p>\n<ul><li>If you are thinking of cheating by using blocks or crates to make these secret holes easier, think again! Golf balls on Fairway Island go through these items.</li>\n<li>You can only get to the secret hole 19 with one shot, as the distance from the shore to the hole is too long.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831150429\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 82/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 668/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019517/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.301      1 -total\n 93.25%   23.593      1 Template:Buildings\n  6.51%    1.647      1 Template:Under_Construction\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4151-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831150429 and revision id 20971. Rendering was triggered because: pag